(CHAPTER 1: EXECUTIVE SYSTEM SUMMARY) Tj
T*
0 Tc
(DocuChat is an enterprise-grade conversational AI platform designed to transform static corporate) Tj
T*
0 Tc
(documents into interactive, searchable knowledge bases. Unlike standard generative chatbots,) Tj
T*
0 Tc
(DocuChat guarantees strict factual grounding by enforcing a deterministic Retrieval-Augmented) Tj
T*
0 Tc
(Generation \(RAG\) pipeline.) Tj
T*
0 Tc
() Tj
T*
0 Tc
(Key Architectural Pillars:) Tj
T*
0 Tc
(1. End-to-End Cryptographic Privacy: All user uploads are encrypted at rest with AES-256-CBC.) Tj
T*
0 Tc
(2. Volatile Memory Decryption: Document buffers are decrypted only within volatile RAM during vector) Tj
T*
0 Tc
(   indexing and are never exposed as plaintext on physical storage media.) Tj
T*
0 Tc
(3. Pinpoint Source Attribution: Every model claim links directly to its source document and page number.) Tj
T*
0 Tc
(4. Anti-Hallucination Guardrails: Prevents speculative responses when documents lack relevant context.) Tj
T*
0 Tc
() Tj
T*
0 Tc
(Expected Benchmark Result for Page 1:) Tj
T*
0 Tc
(When queried about 'What are the key architectural pillars?', the system should return all four points.) Tj
T*
